Drop your .glb arena files here.

Naming convention (Vite fingerprints them automatically):
  plant.glb  steel.glb  water.glb  rock.glb  dark.glb  fire.glb
  ice.glb    field.glb  null.glb   wind.glb  light.glb

The filename before .glb must match one of the 11 element keys above.
The build produces content-hashed URLs (e.g. fire-Ax7Kf2.glb) so
browsers get fresh bytes on every content change - no cache hell.
